{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 157898, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 105643, "uid": 92835, "type": 4, "title": "如何提高天子练度", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1654134962, "updated_at": 1671068230, "updated_uid": 92835, "comment_at": 1689557179, "last_at": 1723367067, "comment_count": 30, "status": 1, "summary": "前言本攻略从提高练度的难易程度为第一排序标准，以性价比为第二标准。标题为简介，图文介绍在折叠里面入门1.达到S好感好感度对练度的提升很高，甚至大于从0级升到50级的提升。2.升到60级，升级技能1.刷", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/515971.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/646336.PNG,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/54793.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 46, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 88949, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 76, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 157898, "content": "<div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">前言</span></span></span></span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">本攻略从提高练度的难易程度为第一排序标准，以性价比为第二标准。</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">标题为简介，图文介绍在折叠里面</span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">入门</span></span></span></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span></span></div><div><div><div style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">1. 达到 S 好感</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/515971.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/515971.png\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px; height: 693px; width: 320px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/646336.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/646336.PNG\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 13.9999px; height: 693px; width: 320px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">好感度</span>对练度的提升很高，甚至大于从0级升到50级的提升。</div></div></div>\n                               </div><br></div></div></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">2. 升到 60 级，升级技能</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/54793.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/54793.png\" style=\"height: 693px; width: 320px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/911255.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/911255.PNG\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:320px;height:693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div class=\"div-img\">1. <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">刷图升级：</span><span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">刷的副本为上图1，章节4 具体关卡看红框</span>。<span style=\"text-decoration-line: line-through;\">推荐使用<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/51773.html\" target=\"_blank\">三星达比</a>1带4。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">现在有扫荡了，直接上五个需要练级的角色，然后扫荡即可。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">双倍经验：北京时间每天的下午6点~下午8点。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">2. <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">史莱姆喂：</span>如图2，快速升级。此方式是游戏中期练度玩家常用方式。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/659987.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/659987.png\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:320px;height:693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/156282.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/156282.PNG\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">五星升六星</span>（属性进一步提高，等级变成1级，最大等级提升至60级），材料为5个五星，可以是升星材料也可以是任意五星，前期到后期常用的方式是先将<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">四星升到满级</span>然后<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">升五星</span>再作为五星升六星的材料。不是五星多的用不掉强烈<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">不推荐</span>用胎生五星天子作为升星材料。</span><br><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/74801.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/74801.PNG\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"></div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">提升技能等级</span>：未突破时只能升到10级，每突破一次，等级上限增加10级，最高70级。使用金币即可升级，金币不足时，上图中的第一项普通攻击可以不升级。</span></div></div></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></div></div>\n                               </div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:13.9999px;\">3. 随便套上点装备，但不要升级装备</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/985214.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/985214.png\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">注意：魂卡必须S好感才可以佩戴</span></div></div>\n                               </div><br></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">渐入佳境</span></div></div><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container active-item\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">1. 开始泡温泉，前期升级很快</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/742399.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/742399.PNG\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/433189.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/433189.PNG\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;width:320px;height:693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">温泉</span>入口见图1，四个池在哪个池子泡效果是一样的。每个天子泡温泉消耗一个毛巾（价值290温泉币），6小时后泡完，每个小时可以领取一次温泉币（收菜），一次约320左右，没有脚本这个菜咱就不收了，每个小时上线去收一次太累了。泡完获得1700灵气（温泉经验值），温泉等级越高升级需要的灵气越多，所以这个就是耗时的工程。<br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">温泉等级</span>的提高可以提高天子的基础属性，每一级（<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">HP，攻击力，防御力，敏捷，暴击</span>）五属性都会提高，所以温泉对天子练度的提升是很明显的，以老八为例0级和100级五属性差<span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">10909</span>点。</div></span><div class=\"div-img\"></div></div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">泡温泉本质上是消耗体力的活动</span>，如果你四个池子都泡满的话，为了满足毛巾的消耗，你最少要抓鬼2~3轮每天（抓鬼可以获得温泉币），每一轮消耗500体力，没有体力要花金币去买。如果觉得扛不住可以只泡1~2个池子，但是我还是推荐泡满，温泉是大佬和萌新人人平等的地方：纯消耗时间。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/289181.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/289181.PNG\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/609821.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/609821.PNG\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;width:320px;height:693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"></div></span></div></div>\n                               </div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">2. 开始追求突破值</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/214234.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/214234.png\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">相同的天子可献祭使另一个突破值+1。突破后技能上限增加10级，基础属性上升一点点。</span></div></div>\n                               </div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">3. 追求T0，T1装备并且升满级，练和佩戴通用性高的魂卡</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">装备图鉴表<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/80674.html\" target=\"_blank\">点击这里</a>。<div>魂卡攻略<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/96710.html\" target=\"_blank\">点击这里</a>，就练通用里面S评价及以上的就行了。</div></span><div></div></div>\n                               </div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">4. 尽量做到每日制作一个点火石</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/802895.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/802895.PNG\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/553919.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/553919.PNG\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;width:320px;height:693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">每天一个点火石完成任务，送的粉尘可以换10个点火石碎片箱子，相当于打九折。</span></div></div>\n                               </div><br></span></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">准毕业</span></div></div></span></div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-size:16px;\">1. 高突破，使用非狗粮点火石为主石头点火至满火</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\">+4以上属于高突破</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/169476.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/169476.png\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/364628.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/364628.PNG\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:320px;height:693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">点火时<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">只有第一颗石头的词条生效</span>，其他的11颗的属性不生效，所以除了第一颗，其他的都用狗粮。鉴定点火石是否是狗粮<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/95715.html\" target=\"_blank\">点击这里</a>。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/634213.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/634213.PNG\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/347714.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/347714.PNG\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;width:320px;height:693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"></span><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">点满火需要<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">同属性的胎生五星 5个</span>，</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; font-weight: bold;\">点火时点击问号按钮可以查看点火前后技能变化</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">。中间的一列，每点亮一个节点相对于的激活一颗红心（由黄色星变成红色星），平时说的<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">点3火</span>的意思就是<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">点到中间一列第三个节点</span>。</span></span></div></span></div></div>\n                               </div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">2. 装备附魔，重点在一号位二号位。特别是防具二号位饰品二号位。</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">附魔评价<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/87997.html\">点击这里</a>。<div><div>Raid刀附魔<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/88021.html\" target=\"_blank\">点击这里</a>。</div></div></span><div><div></div></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">3. 追求高契合度的魂卡，最好是闪卡</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\">魂卡攻略<a href=\"https://destinychild.gamekee.com/96710.html\" target=\"_blank\">点击这里</a>。</div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">4. 持续的泡温泉，有二星三星礼物就送</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/480443.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/480443.PNG\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/502765.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/502765.PNG\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;width:320px;height:693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">点击左边的礼物按钮赠送礼物，上图中没有二星三星礼物就不建议送了。送礼增加温泉灵气（经验值）。每一轮泡澡<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">每个天子最多</span>只能送5个礼物。</span></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></span></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">真毕业</span></div></div></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">1. T0装备+毕业附魔+佩戴契合的50级+5闪魂卡</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">2. 突破至+6，使用毕业点火石作为主石头</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">3. 温泉等级达到100</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/191999.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/191999.PNG\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">最后100级一级加巨量的基础属性。</span></div></div>\n                               </div><br><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-model-type=\"1\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\">4. 佩戴契合的玩偶（不是每个天子都有契合的）</div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/499094.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/499094.png\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/620920.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/5/2/620920.PNG\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;width:320px;height:693px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2436\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\">（<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;\">老八和上图2不是最契合的玩偶，不要盲目抄作业，上玩偶免费，但是卸玩偶很贵</span>）</span></div></div>\n             